  {
   "id": "greedy",
   "version": "1",
   "description": "the V0.3 protocol demonstration (agent.Greedy): raises one radiologist's site reading allocation by 5 points whenever the oldest unread study is over a day old; not a strategy"
  },
  {
   "id": "rules",
   "version": "1",
   "description": "a modest rule-based baseline: reading allocation follows the reading backlog with hysteresis, every change validated and previewed first"
  },
  {
   "id": "python-ref",
   "version": "1",
   "description": "the reference external policy (clients/python/reference_policy.py): a weekly review that raises one site reading allocation by 5 points, validated first, when the oldest unfinished study is over a day old; not a strategy",
